id: pm-rl-qdxu
title: "A registered seed cannot parent any candidate, and the tests hide it by writing outside the command surface"
description: "CodeRabbit review of pm-rl#12, Major. registerGeneration sets a seed's policy to the empty string, and every candidate's collection runs must carry component equal to the parent's policy. rl run start always sets a non-empty algorithm as the component, so EVERY candidate parented to a freshly registered seed is refused with run_policy_mismatch, and no command ever sets the seed's policy afterward.\n\nThe reviewer found why the suite is nonetheless green: the test helper giveSeedPolicy rewrites the seed body through a raw client.update, STEPPING OUTSIDE THE COMMAND SURFACE. The tests prove the internals work while the product does not - a green suite over an unusable end-to-end path.\n\nFix by accepting a policy for the seed registration, or by skipping the run-policy check when the parent is a seed with no recorded policy. The regression test must parent a candidate to a seed using ONLY published commands, with no raw client writes."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-10T23:30:50.162Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-11T04:55:34.090Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-11T04:55:34.078Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-11T04:55:34.078Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
resolution: Seed accepts --policy; empty-policy seed skips the run-policy check; giveSeedPolicy deleted; regression uses commands only.
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-rl-yi7j,parent,"2026-08-10T23:31:11.361Z","harness:claude-code","cli:update:dep",detected
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T04:55:31.784Z",pi-agent,"registerGeneration accepts an optional --policy on seed registration (stored in the seed spec). When the parent is a seed whose recorded policy is empty, the run-policy check is skipped (no declared policy to violate); a seed WITH a policy still enforces run_policy_mismatch. Deleted the giveSeedPolicy helper (raw client.update) — grep confirms 0 giveSeedPolicy occurrences. Regression test parents a candidate to an empty-policy seed whose run uses a different algorithm, using only published commands. Revert-proof: reverting the skip fails the empty-policy test with run_policy_mismatch."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T04:55:33.706Z",pi-agent,"A green suite can hide an unusable end-to-end path when a test helper fabricates state through a raw client.update outside the command surface; assert the command surface itself, not the internals."
